type: software
title: "kittens"
abstract: >-
  Pixel-art kittens that live inside any element of a web page. They read the real
  layout to walk, run, jump onto elements, climb walls, play, groom and sleep on their
  own. Ships as a dependency-free Web Component and TypeScript class.
